1
00:00:02,66 --> 00:00:06,73
-Thanks for the tasty dinner. -You're welcome for a tasty dinner.
謝謝你煮的好料 隨時都歡迎

2
00:00:07,07 --> 00:00:08,97
What are you guys looking at?
你們在看什麼？

3
00:00:09,14 --> 00:00:11,54
Ross and the most beautiful girl in the world.
羅斯和宇宙無敵第一美女

4
00:00:11,91 --> 00:00:13,74
Yeah,come to Papa!
好騷的娘兒們

5
00:00:19,21 --> 00:00:20,58
I know!
我知道

6
00:00:22,68 --> 00:00:24,68
Probably the only time I'll say this...
這實在不像我會說的話

7
00:00:24,89 --> 00:00:27,25
...but did you see the ass on her?
但你們看到她的屁股了嗎？

8
00:00:27,49 --> 00:00:29,72
What did you...? When did you...?
你是…你是…

9
00:00:29,99 --> 00:00:32,89
How did you...? How did you get a girl like that?
你怎麼… 你怎麼把到那種貨色的？

10
00:00:34,10 --> 00:00:38,40
So what is she,like a spokesmodel? An aerobics instructor?
她是誰，代言模特兒？ 有氧舞蹈教練？

11
00:00:38,63 --> 00:00:41,93
Actually,she's a paleontology doctoral candidate...
她是古生物學博士候選人 

12
00:00:42,14 --> 00:00:44,30
...specializing in the Cenozoic Era.
專攻新生代

13
00:00:44,91 --> 00:00:47,14
But that's,like,the easiest era.
不過那是最簡單的時代

14
00:00:48,84 --> 00:00:51,68
I've seen her at work, but I always figured....
我在館裡見過她，但總覺得…

15
00:00:53,88 --> 00:00:56,37
But I made her dinner.
總之我做飯給她吃

16
00:00:56,68 --> 00:01:00,09
We had a great time. And we're going out again tomorrow.
我們聊得很愉快 明天還要見面

17
00:01:02,59 --> 00:01:06,49
Maybe her friends are betting to see who gets the biggest geek.
也許她跟朋友打賭 誰能釣到最怪的怪胎

18
00:01:06,73 --> 00:01:09,06
Fine by me. Hope she wins.
我無所謂，祝她勝利

19
00:01:11,33 --> 00:01:14,63
Hey,we should have a contest. Yeah.
我們也應該來比

20
00:01:14,80 --> 00:01:17,17
See who can bring home the most beautiful woman.
看誰帶回來的女生最漂亮

21
00:01:17,57 --> 00:01:21,20
That's a good idea,Joe. We could call it life.
好主意 名稱就叫「真實人生」

22
00:01:22,28 --> 00:01:24,27
The One with the Dirty Girl
本集播出：「送禮風波」

00:01:27,28 --> 00:01:29,27
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

23
00:02:09,19 --> 00:02:10,95
You have any wrapping paper?
有包裝紙嗎？

24
00:02:11,26 --> 00:02:13,06
Is it for my birthday present?
你要包我的生日禮物？

25
00:02:13,80 --> 00:02:15,76
It was your birthday months ago.
你生日都過了1個月

26
00:02:16,36 --> 00:02:21,10
You said you ordered something special and it just hadn't come yet.
對，但你說訂了特別的東西 還沒送來

27
00:02:23,44 --> 00:02:25,00
I have a call in about that.
我有接到電話

28
00:02:27,61 --> 00:02:31,41
It's for Kathy. It's an early copy of her favorite book.
這是給凱西的生日禮物 是她最喜歡的書的早期版本

29
00:02:31,58 --> 00:02:34,10
The Velveteen Rabbit!
是「天鵝絨兔寶寶」

30
00:02:34,38 --> 00:02:37,04
When the boy's love makes the rabbit real....
天哪 當男孩的愛讓它變成真兔子…

31
00:02:37,29 --> 00:02:40,65
Don't touch it because your fingers have destructive oils.
好，別摸，你的手有油污

32
00:02:41,89 --> 00:02:44,79
Then you'd better keep it away from Ross' hair.
那你最好別靠近羅斯的頭髮

33
00:02:46,79 --> 00:02:49,23
This is pretty rare. How did you get that?
這很珍貴，你是怎麼找到的？

34
00:02:49,46 --> 00:02:52,06
No big deal. I just went to some bookstores...
沒什麼，我只是跑了幾家書店 問了幾個書商

35
00:02:52,27 --> 00:02:56,64
...talked to some dealers,called some of the author's grandchildren.
聯絡了幾個作者的孫子

36
00:02:56,97 --> 00:02:58,50
Honey,that's so sweet.
真是太感人了

37
00:02:58,81 --> 00:03:03,40
What a great way to say,"l secretly love you,roommate's girlfriend."
完全宣告了 「室友的馬子，我在暗戀你」

38
00:03:04,61 --> 00:03:06,10
It doesn't say that.
哪會啊…

39
00:03:06,78 --> 00:03:07,77
Does it?
會嗎？

40
00:03:08,42 --> 00:03:12,68
How will it look when you get her something incredibly meaningful...
你自己看嘛 你送的禮物別具意義又昂貴

41
00:03:12,92 --> 00:03:16,91
...and expensive,and her boyfriend, Joey,gives her an orange?
她的男朋友卻送她一個柳橙

42
00:03:17,46 --> 00:03:20,83
I'll make sure Joey gets her something really great.
好 我會叫喬伊送她很好的禮物

43
00:03:20,96 --> 00:03:23,29
It's got to be better than that book.
可得比那本書還好

44
00:03:23,53 --> 00:03:25,09
Like a crossbow!
像十字弓啦

45
00:03:27,44 --> 00:03:29,03
Once again,I am sorry.
真的很抱歉

46
00:03:29,54 --> 00:03:31,03
Thank you. Bye.
謝謝，再見

47
00:03:32,44 --> 00:03:36,07
I had to turn down a job catering a funeral for 60 people.
我推掉一個60人的喪禮外燴

48
00:03:36,44 --> 00:03:39,28
Oh,my God! What happened?
天哪，出了什麼事？

49
00:03:39,78 --> 00:03:41,37
Sixty guests.
是60個「客人」

50
00:03:45,22 --> 00:03:47,05
Why'd you have to turn it down?
你為什麼要推掉？

51
00:03:47,26 --> 00:03:49,55
I don't have the money or equipment...
因為我沒有錢和用具 

52
00:03:49,79 --> 00:03:53,25
...to handle something that big on such short notice.
可以臨時接這種大生意

54
00:03:53,46 --> 00:03:55,73
Wow,what is with all the negativity?
這麼消極是怎麼回事？

55
00:03:56,33 --> 00:03:59,23
You sound like "Moni-can't," not "Moni-can"!
你好像「摩妮不可」 而不是「摩妮可」

56
00:04:01,00 --> 00:04:02,49
Moni-ca.
摩妮「卡」

57
00:04:04,11 --> 00:04:07,51
You've been playing around with this catering for years.
你辦外燴都3年多了

58
00:04:07,74 --> 00:04:10,34
-Do you want to be a caterer? -I don't know.
你到底想不想當外燴廚師？ 我不知道

59
00:04:10,58 --> 00:04:12,51
There you go! That's the spirit!
這就對了！

60
00:04:14,15 --> 00:04:18,08
If you need money,I will lend you money. Just get moving!
你需要錢我借你，你就接吧

61
00:04:18,32 --> 00:04:21,76
Really? I'd need $500 for all the food and supplies.
真的？我需要5百元來採買

62
00:04:22,02 --> 00:04:26,59
It's worth it if it'll get you moving. You haven't worked in months!
好，能讓你接就值得 你好幾個月沒工作了

63
00:04:26,79 --> 00:04:30,42
-Neither have you. -Yes,but I'm doing this.
你也是 但我正在資助你

65
00:04:31,03 --> 00:04:33,16
That would be great! Thank you.
太好了，謝謝

66
00:04:37,94 --> 00:04:41,77
-Can I borrow your apartment keys? -Why?
你家的鑰匙借我 為什麼？

68
00:04:44,61 --> 00:04:45,81
You can pee here.
你可以在這裡尿啊

69
00:04:49,98 --> 00:04:52,11
Yes,I can,of course.
也對

70
00:04:53,19 --> 00:04:56,28
It's okay. The duck's using our bathroom anyway.
不好意思 反正剛好鴨子也在用浴室

71
00:04:59,79 --> 00:05:01,82
What are you getting for her birthday?
你要送她什麼生日禮物？

72
00:05:02,10 --> 00:05:06,00
We've been dating a couple weeks. I got to get her something?
我們才交往2星期也要送嗎？

73
00:05:06,23 --> 00:05:08,93
You have to get her something really nice.
要啊 不但要送，還要送得很好

75
00:05:10,07 --> 00:05:12,27
-I know! -And not one of your coupons...
有了！ 1小時的...

76
00:05:12,51 --> 00:05:14,24
...for an hour of "Joey Love."
...喬伊猛男體驗券不算

77
00:05:20,35 --> 00:05:23,32
-A crossword! Can I help? -No.
填字遊戲！我可以幫忙嗎？ 不行

78
00:05:23,48 --> 00:05:25,68
Last week I got all but three answers...
對不起 可是上星期我幾乎全答對了

79
00:05:25,89 --> 00:05:28,48
...and I want to finish one without any help.
我很想獨力完成一次

80
00:05:28,79 --> 00:05:29,78
Fine.
好

81
00:05:30,06 --> 00:05:33,79
But you can't help me develop my new universal language.
那你也不能幫我研發新宇宙語

82
00:05:35,86 --> 00:05:36,89
How'd it go?
怎麼樣？

83
00:05:37,17 --> 00:05:40,16
Oh,my God! It was the best funeral ever!
天哪，這個葬禮太棒了

84
00:05:41,07 --> 00:05:42,97
Everyone loved the food.
每個人都說好吃

85
00:05:43,20 --> 00:05:45,67
I even got another funeral for tomorrow.
我還接了明天的另一場葬禮

86
00:05:45,87 --> 00:05:48,07
The dead guy from today's best friend.
是今天的死者的死黨

87
00:05:48,54 --> 00:05:52,21
It's like I am the official caterer for that accident.
我成了那場事故的指定外燴

88
00:05:52,41 --> 00:05:54,38
Mon,I'm so happy for you!
我真替你高興

89
00:05:54,58 --> 00:05:57,31
Thanks. Check out my new catering stuff.
謝了，你看我的新用具

90
00:05:57,89 --> 00:05:59,85
Look! I'm an omelet station!
看，我可以去賣蛋卷

91
00:06:00,25 --> 00:06:02,05
Omelet? Made to order?
要特製蛋卷嗎？

92
00:06:03,09 --> 00:06:05,58
I'll have one,please. Plus my money.
請給我一份，還有我的錢

93
00:06:08,16 --> 00:06:10,65
I didn't realize you needed it right away.
我不曉得你馬上就要

94
00:06:10,93 --> 00:06:14,39
You told me to go and be a caterer. So I went. I be'd.
你叫我去當外燴廚師 我就去了

95
00:06:15,94 --> 00:06:17,56
I used it to buy all this stuff.
我把錢都花掉了

96
00:06:17,74 --> 00:06:20,00
Aborigine.
「原住民」！

97
00:06:22,04 --> 00:06:23,01
不對

98
00:06:24,31 --> 00:06:27,61
I got another job tomorrow, so I'll pay you back then.
我明天還有生意 到時就能還你

99
00:06:28,78 --> 00:06:31,25
Okay. Sorry I acted like a bank.
好，抱歉剛才一副銀行嘴臉

100
00:06:33,22 --> 00:06:37,12
Aborigine. Oh,no,I tried that already.
「原住民」！ 不對，我已經試過了

102
00:06:50,71 --> 00:06:52,17
Would you like to come in?
你要進來嗎？

103
00:06:52,84 --> 00:06:56,71
Did Homo erectus hunt with wooden tools?
直立人是用木器打獵嗎？

104
00:06:58,21 --> 00:07:00,04
According to recent findings.
最新證據顯示是的

105
00:07:11,33 --> 00:07:13,73
Here,Mitzi! Here,Mitzi!
蜜琪來，蜜琪來

106
00:07:15,36 --> 00:07:17,13
Mitzi is...?
蜜琪是… 

107
00:07:17,33 --> 00:07:19,13
My hamster.
我的倉鼠

108
00:07:19,97 --> 00:07:22,30
I hope she's okay. I haven't seen her in a while.
但願它沒事，好久沒見到它了

109
00:07:23,17 --> 00:07:24,37
Have a seat.
請坐

110
00:07:24,57 --> 00:07:25,97
Where?
（坐哪裡？）

111
00:07:27,68 --> 00:07:29,51
Oh,hey. Do you....
對了，你…

112
00:07:33,75 --> 00:07:36,72
Do you have any Cinnamon Fruit Toasties?
你有肉桂水果烤吐司嗎？

113
00:07:37,82 --> 00:07:39,51
Well,I do.
什麼？ 我有

114
00:07:40,89 --> 00:07:43,98
Let's go back to my place, light a couple candles...
我們回我家去，點幾根蠟燭

115
00:07:44,23 --> 00:07:47,99
...break open a box of Cinnamon Fruit Toasties....
開一盒肉桂水果烤吐司

116
00:07:49,56 --> 00:07:52,69
-I'd rather not. -Oh,yeah? Why not?
還是不要好了 為什麼？

118
00:07:54,17 --> 00:07:56,50
Don't take this the wrong way...
我沒有惡意

119
00:07:56,74 --> 00:08:00,17
...but your place kind of has a weird smell.
但是你家有一股怪味

120
00:08:07,38 --> 00:08:10,44
-ls everything in the car? -Did you settle the bill?
東西都上車了？ 對，錢拿到了嗎？

121
00:08:11,42 --> 00:08:13,18
I hate this part.
還沒，我最討厭要錢了

122
00:08:14,46 --> 00:08:16,45
Look what we almost left!
差點忘了這個

123
00:08:16,69 --> 00:08:18,12
That's not mine.
那不是我的

124
00:08:18,86 --> 00:08:21,26
Look what we almost took!
差點偷了這個

125
00:08:28,60 --> 00:08:30,23
Excuse me,Mrs. Burkart?
柏卡特太太？

126
00:08:30,74 --> 00:08:32,37
Well,we're all cleaned up.
廚房都收拾好了

127
00:08:33,64 --> 00:08:35,97
Good. Thank you.
很好，謝謝你

128
00:08:39,48 --> 00:08:43,38
And,well,there's this small matter of the....
還有一件小事…

129
00:08:44,42 --> 00:08:46,25
-Dear? -The matter of...
什麼事？ 就是…

130
00:08:47,56 --> 00:08:48,65
...payment.
費用的事

131
00:08:49,79 --> 00:08:53,59
Jack used to handle the finances.
錢都是傑克在管

132
00:09:00,33 --> 00:09:03,03
-You get it? -No,but I made a widow cry.
拿到了嗎？ 沒有，但是把未亡人惹哭了

133
00:09:03,17 --> 00:09:05,50
See you in hell.
我們會被打下十八層地獄

134
00:09:12,08 --> 00:09:14,41
You know what we should all do?
你知道嗎？ 

135
00:09:14,62 --> 00:09:16,74
Go see a musical.
我們應該去看歌舞劇

136
00:09:19,25 --> 00:09:20,72
Sure.
好

137
00:09:22,02 --> 00:09:23,42
You know which one?
你知道應該看哪一部？

138
00:09:24,69 --> 00:09:27,59
The 1996 Tony Award winner.
1996年東尼獎得獎作品 

139
00:09:28,43 --> 00:09:31,16
I mean,that one's gotta be good.
那部戲一定贊

140
00:09:32,03 --> 00:09:33,86
Do you know the name of that one?
你知道它的名字嗎？

141
00:09:34,27 --> 00:09:36,60
I don't know. Grease?
不曉得，「火爆浪子」？

142
00:09:38,24 --> 00:09:39,26
不是

143
00:09:41,54 --> 00:09:42,87
Rent?
「吉屋出租」？

144
00:09:43,31 --> 00:09:45,18
Yes! Rent!
對！「吉屋出租」

145
00:09:46,05 --> 00:09:47,54
So when do you want to go?
好，什麼時候去？

146
00:09:47,78 --> 00:09:50,27
What? I'm sorry. I can't,I'm busy.
什麼？ 我不行，我很忙

147
00:09:55,69 --> 00:09:58,99
Man,it is so hard to shop for girls.
天哪，女孩子的禮物真難買

148
00:10:00,06 --> 00:10:01,05
Yes,it is...
的確很難…

149
00:10:01,30 --> 00:10:03,32
...at Office Max!
文具店？

150
00:10:05,47 --> 00:10:06,96
What did you get her?
你買了什麼？

151
00:10:08,30 --> 00:10:09,96
A pen.
一支筆

152
00:10:10,97 --> 00:10:15,41
It's two gifts in one. It's a pen that's also a clock.
這是二合一，是筆，也是時鐘

153
00:10:16,64 --> 00:10:19,34
-You can't give her that. -Why not?
你不能送這個 為什麼？

154
00:10:19,65 --> 00:10:20,74
She's not 11!
她不是小孩子

155
00:10:22,55 --> 00:10:25,18
And it's not the seventh night of Chanukah.
這也不是光明節結束前夕

156
00:10:27,76 --> 00:10:31,69
What he means by that is, while this is a very nice gift...
他的意思是，這個禮物雖然好

157
00:10:31,93 --> 00:10:34,49
...maybe it's not something a boyfriend gives.
卻不適合送給女朋友

158
00:10:34,70 --> 00:10:36,03
Sure it is.
當然適合

159
00:10:36,26 --> 00:10:37,49
She needs a pen for work.
她上班要用到筆

160
00:10:37,77 --> 00:10:42,33
She's writing. She turns it over. "It's time for my date with Joey!"
寫到一半轉過來一看 哇，該去跟喬伊約會了

162
00:10:44,37 --> 00:10:48,57
All right. What did you get for Angela Del Veccio's birthday?
好 你送安琪拉什麼生日禮物？

163
00:10:49,38 --> 00:10:50,90
She didn't have one.
我們交往時沒碰上生日

164
00:10:51,41 --> 00:10:53,35
For three years?
整整3年？

165
00:10:55,88 --> 00:10:58,68
Look,it's too late, and I got an audition.
已經來不及了，我還要試鏡 

166
00:10:58,92 --> 00:11:00,91
I can't shop anymore.
我不能再找了

167
00:11:02,56 --> 00:11:05,86
I will go out and try to find something for her.
我去幫你找，好嗎？

168
00:11:06,56 --> 00:11:07,72
Thanks,man.
謝了

169
00:11:07,96 --> 00:11:11,06
While you're at it, could you get her a card?
你能不能順便買張卡片？

170
00:11:11,80 --> 00:11:14,93
Would you like me to write her a little poem as well?
要不要我順便寫一首小詩？

171
00:11:15,14 --> 00:11:19,10
Or just get a card that has a poem already in it.
或是買張印了詩的卡片

172
00:11:20,14 --> 00:11:26,31
Oh,so it's a card, but it's also a poem-holder.
那是一張卡片，也是一頁詩

173
00:11:29,22 --> 00:11:33,35
-You have to get our money. -She couldn't stop crying.
你得把錢要到 但是她哭個不停

174
00:11:33,52 --> 00:11:37,05
With those thick glasses, her tears look giant.
眼淚還被眼鏡放大了

175
00:11:37,46 --> 00:11:38,69
I know,it's tough.
我知道很難

176
00:11:38,89 --> 00:11:42,12
You know what the first thing I did after my mom's funeral was?
你知道我媽一下葬我做了什麼

177
00:11:42,30 --> 00:11:44,20
-What? -Pay the caterer!
什麼？ 付錢給外燴廚師

178
00:11:45,23 --> 00:11:46,67
I've had a lot of jobs.
我做過很多工作

179
00:11:46,87 --> 00:11:50,83
And there are some people who always try to get out of paying.
有些人總是想賴帳

180
00:11:51,11 --> 00:11:53,77
It's either "That massage wasn't long enough"...
不是「按摩時間不夠長」

181
00:11:53,97 --> 00:11:56,20
...or "l don't know any of those songs"...
就是「我沒聽過這幾首歌」

182
00:11:56,41 --> 00:12:00,44
...or "These sombreros aren't big enough. Bad little white girl!"
或「這些墨西哥草帽不夠大」 「壞心眼的白妞」

183
00:12:02,98 --> 00:12:04,75
So you think she's faking?
你覺得她在裝？

184
00:12:05,05 --> 00:12:08,58
There weren't any tears till you showed her the bill.
你拿出帳單前她根本沒哭

185
00:12:08,79 --> 00:12:10,72
She sounded pretty upset to me.
她聽起來很難過

186
00:12:18,40 --> 00:12:20,59
She seems fine now.
現在似乎沒事了

187
00:12:24,94 --> 00:12:28,14
So you just left? Her place was really that bad?
所以你就走了？ 她家真的那麼髒？

188
00:12:28,38 --> 00:12:31,97
You throw your jacket on a chair at the end of the day.
我們下班回家 會把外套扔到椅子上

189
00:12:32,28 --> 00:12:36,08
Like that,only instead of a chair, it's a pile of garbage.
在她家是扔到一堆垃圾上

190
00:12:37,65 --> 00:12:40,64
And instead of a jacket, it's a pile of garbage.
那也不是外套，而是一堆垃圾

191
00:12:41,99 --> 00:12:45,48
And instead of the end of the day, it's the end of time...
那也不是下班回家 而是世界末日

192
00:12:45,73 --> 00:12:47,99
...and garbage is all that has survived.
只有垃圾存留下來

193
00:12:50,40 --> 00:12:52,56
-Here. -Wow. Thanks.
拿去 謝了

194
00:12:53,50 --> 00:12:54,97
So what happened?
然後呢？

195
00:12:55,17 --> 00:12:57,50
Nothing. I had to get out of there.
哪有然後，我逃之夭夭

196
00:12:57,74 --> 00:13:00,07
Next time,you take her to your place.
下次你就帶她去你家

197
00:13:00,31 --> 00:13:03,11
I tried that. She says it has a weird smell.
我試過了，她說我家有怪味

198
00:13:04,25 --> 00:13:07,58
-What kind of smell? -I don't know. Soap?
什麼怪味？ 不曉得，香皂味？

199
00:13:08,28 --> 00:13:11,15
-Listen,you like this girl,right? -Yeah.
聽著，你喜歡她對吧？ 對

200
00:13:11,32 --> 00:13:12,68
-You want to see her again? -Yeah.
你想再跟她見面？ 對

201
00:13:12,92 --> 00:13:15,65
So you're going to have to do it in the mess!
那你就得在垃圾裡跟她做

202
00:13:16,76 --> 00:13:18,95
Yeah,okay. You're right.
好吧，你說得對

203
00:13:19,66 --> 00:13:23,10
I mean,who cares about a little sloppiness?
稍微亂一點又怎樣？

204
00:13:25,27 --> 00:13:27,67
-It's endearing,really. -All right!
其實蠻可愛的 很好

205
00:13:27,94 --> 00:13:30,87
Now you go get that beautiful pig!
去撂倒那只美麗的豬吧

206
00:13:40,71 --> 00:13:44,28
I just spent the entire afternoon looking for a present...
我花了一下午替凱西找一件

208
00:13:44,49 --> 00:13:47,28
...for Kathy that would be better than the rabbit.
比這隻兔子好的禮物

209
00:13:47,45 --> 00:13:48,44
Any luck?
有找到嗎？

210
00:13:48,62 --> 00:13:53,03
Yeah,I found this great place called "lnvisible Things for Kathy."
有，我找到一家店 叫「送給凱西的隱形禮物」

211
00:13:53,29 --> 00:13:56,13
Can you give me a hand with all this stuff?
你能不能幫我搬一這些禮物？

212
00:13:56,46 --> 00:13:59,99
Just return the book, let Joey give her the clock pen...
你就把書退回去 讓喬伊送她那支時鐘筆

213
00:14:00,23 --> 00:14:02,96
...and you get her something worse than that...
你送個更差的東西，例如…

214
00:14:03,20 --> 00:14:04,54
...Iike a regular pen.
一支普通的筆

215
00:14:05,84 --> 00:14:08,57
She's really going to love this,you know?
她會很喜歡這本書

216
00:14:09,18 --> 00:14:11,80
The bottom line is, I want her to have it...
我希望她擁有這本書

217
00:14:12,01 --> 00:14:15,38
...even if I don't get to be the one who gives it to her.
就算不是我送的也行

218
00:14:15,68 --> 00:14:17,58
Honey,that's so sweet.
好感人喔

219
00:14:18,89 --> 00:14:21,01
You don't think it's just pathetic?
你不覺得很可悲嗎？

220
00:14:21,36 --> 00:14:23,08
Oh,"pathetic"!
是「可悲」！

221
00:14:26,69 --> 00:14:29,25
I've been looking all over for you.
我要去見凱西了，我到處找你

222
00:14:29,46 --> 00:14:32,76
-Where? -Our place. The hall.
在哪裡找？ 家裡啦，大廳啦

224
00:14:36,50 --> 00:14:39,20
I got something for her.
我找到禮物了

225
00:14:44,51 --> 00:14:46,45
It's a book.
是一本書

226
00:14:47,41 --> 00:14:48,54
A book?
書？

227
00:14:50,18 --> 00:14:52,55
Is it a book that's also a safe?
是書也是保險盒？

228
00:14:55,02 --> 00:14:56,79
It's a book that's just a book.
它就是一本書

229
00:14:57,02 --> 00:15:00,79
It's the Velveteen Rabbit. It was her favorite as a kid.
是她小時候最喜歡的書 「天鵝絨兔寶寶」的珍本

230
00:15:01,10 --> 00:15:03,62
So just let me know if she likes it,okay?
讓我知道她喜不喜歡，好嗎？

231
00:15:03,86 --> 00:15:07,36
You got it. Thanks for doing this. I owe you one.
沒問題 謝謝你，我欠你一次

232
00:15:11,11 --> 00:15:14,30
There wasn't any change from that twenty,was there?
那20塊沒有找錢是吧？

233
00:15:15,11 --> 00:15:17,77
No,it came out to an even twenty.
沒有，剛好20塊

234
00:15:19,45 --> 00:15:22,61
Wow. That's almost as much as a new book.
哇，跟新書差不多貴

235
00:15:35,66 --> 00:15:39,43
-You didn't get the money? -Maybe I can try at intermission?
還是沒要到，對吧？ 等她暫停再去好了

237
00:15:40,30 --> 00:15:42,57
You know what? Let's just go.
我們就走吧

238
00:15:43,10 --> 00:15:45,16
We're not leaving till we get paid!
不行，錢沒拿到不能走

239
00:15:45,64 --> 00:15:47,66
I don't know who she thinks she is.
她以為她是誰啊

240
00:15:47,94 --> 00:15:50,34
I talked to the florist. She didn't get paid either.
我問過，花店也沒拿到錢

241
00:15:50,51 --> 00:15:56,11
Or the limo driver,or the priest,and he can get the dead guy damned for all eternity.
還有靈車司機和神父 但他可以咒那個死人不得超生

242
00:15:57,15 --> 00:16:00,31
Well,I'm not going back out there.
我不要再去了

243
00:16:00,45 --> 00:16:02,22
Fine. Enough is enough!
好，我受夠了

244
00:16:03,72 --> 00:16:05,16
Hey,widow?
喂，未亡人

245
00:16:06,39 --> 00:16:07,42
Widow?
死老公的

246
00:16:08,00 --> 00:16:09,49
Excuse me? Excuse me!
打擾一下

247
00:16:11,83 --> 00:16:16,13
Thanks. Clearly this is a very,very hard time for you.
謝了 你現在當然十分難過

248
00:16:16,34 --> 00:16:19,57
But we provided a service, and we deserve to be paid...
但我們提供服務 就該領到費用

249
00:16:19,77 --> 00:16:21,67
...because you ate that service.
因為你吃都吃了

250
00:16:21,91 --> 00:16:26,18
We are not leaving here until we are paid every penny,because...
錢沒付清我們不會走

251
00:16:26,41 --> 00:16:30,65
...we're part-time caterers and we have no place else to go.
因為我們是兼職的，不必趕場

252
00:16:31,99 --> 00:16:34,32
All right. I'll get my bag.
好，我去拿皮包 

253
00:16:34,92 --> 00:16:36,62
Good.
很好

254
00:16:43,83 --> 00:16:46,16
I'm going to leave some cards here.
我留幾張名片

255
00:16:48,14 --> 00:16:51,47
Please think of us for your next event.
下次有需要請考慮我們

256
00:16:57,61 --> 00:16:59,10
So you want to come inside?
你想進來嗎？

257
00:17:00,31 --> 00:17:01,51
Yes.
想

258
00:17:03,65 --> 00:17:05,55
Yes,I do.
我想

259
00:17:15,23 --> 00:17:18,03
I'll be right back. Make yourself comfortable.
我馬上回來，你隨便坐

260
00:17:42,06 --> 00:17:44,42
Guess who?
猜猜我是誰？

261
00:17:45,56 --> 00:17:48,08
Department of Sanitation?
衛生稽查人員？

262
00:17:49,33 --> 00:17:50,39
It's me.
是我

263
00:18:04,95 --> 00:18:05,93
What?
怎麼了？

264
00:18:06,45 --> 00:18:08,04
Oh,Cheryl!
喔！雪柔

265
00:18:13,42 --> 00:18:15,15
天哪…

266
00:18:30,80 --> 00:18:34,24
-It's my hamster! It's Mitzi! -Oh,my God!
那是我的倉鼠，是蜜琪 天哪

267
00:18:34,48 --> 00:18:37,07
I'm so sorry. I must have freaked out.
對不起，我嚇到了

268
00:18:37,28 --> 00:18:38,87
Thank God it's not Mitzi!
幸好不是蜜琪

269
00:18:39,98 --> 00:18:41,74
It's just a rat.
只是一隻老鼠

270
00:18:45,59 --> 00:18:46,78
I did it!
完成了

271
00:18:47,49 --> 00:18:50,48
I finished it! I did it all by myself!
我填完了 我一個人把它填完了

272
00:18:50,69 --> 00:18:52,66
And there's nobody to hug.
卻沒有人可抱

273
00:18:53,86 --> 00:18:54,85
Move!

274
00:19:01,84 --> 00:19:03,03
Hey,you guys!
你們！ 

275
00:19:03,27 --> 00:19:05,36
I finished it all by myself! Hug me.
我一個人把字謎填完了，抱我

276
00:19:06,64 --> 00:19:07,83
太棒了

277
00:19:08,28 --> 00:19:10,00
-Congratulations. -Thank you.
恭喜 謝謝

278
00:19:10,28 --> 00:19:11,37
How did it go?
外燴辦得怎樣？ 過癮死了

279
00:19:11,61 --> 00:19:15,64
The widow wouldn't pay, so Phoebe yelled at her till she did.
那個寡婦不肯付錢 菲比就罵到她付錢為止

280
00:19:15,85 --> 00:19:18,01
I'm a hard-ass.
沒錯，我是狠角色

281
00:19:19,89 --> 00:19:23,29
And I'm a wuss. We should be partners.
而我是軟腳蝦 我們應該聯手

282
00:19:23,52 --> 00:19:26,29
Hard-ass and wuss. We could fight crime.
是啊 狠角色和軟腳蝦打擊犯罪

284
00:19:28,46 --> 00:19:29,99
Wait a minute,Phoebe.
等一下，菲比

285
00:19:30,53 --> 00:19:32,23
We should be partners.
我們是該聯手

286
00:19:32,63 --> 00:19:34,53
We should be catering partners.
我們應該合夥辦外燴

287
00:19:34,74 --> 00:19:38,54
You're not working now, and we have a great time together.
你想嘛，你現在沒工作 我們又合作無間

288
00:19:39,74 --> 00:19:42,00
I cook and you take care of the money.
好 我下廚，你管錢

289
00:19:42,21 --> 00:19:44,91
It'll be like I have a wife in the 50s!
我就像娶了個很傳統的老婆

290
00:19:50,88 --> 00:19:52,48
How did she like the gift?
怎樣？她喜歡嗎？

291
00:19:52,75 --> 00:19:55,65
She loved it. She's showing the girls right now.
她愛死了 她拿去隔壁給女生們看

292
00:19:55,89 --> 00:19:57,08
Yeah? That's great.
是嗎？太好了

293
00:19:57,32 --> 00:19:58,62
I got to tell you...
老實說 

294
00:19:58,83 --> 00:20:01,73
...I feel bad taking credit for this,because...
佔了這個功勞我很過意不去

295
00:20:01,96 --> 00:20:04,99
...am I going to get a lot of credit for this!
我可有得爽了

296
00:20:12,14 --> 00:20:14,00
-Happy birthday. -Thank you.
生日快樂 謝謝

297
00:20:14,24 --> 00:20:16,64
You know,Chandler got you a gift too.
錢德也有禮物要送你

299
00:20:18,11 --> 00:20:19,44
No,he didn't.
他沒有

300
00:20:21,75 --> 00:20:25,15
Yeah,he did. Look, it's right there on the counter.
他有，看，就在餐檯上

301
00:20:32,06 --> 00:20:33,55
Happy birthday.
生日快樂…

302
00:20:34,56 --> 00:20:35,89
I'm sorry.
我很抱歉

303
00:20:38,17 --> 00:20:40,03
You really didn't have to.
你何必破費

304
00:20:43,20 --> 00:20:47,57
You think it's just a pen,but you turn it over and it's also a clock.
你以為這是一支筆 其實轉過來還有時鐘

305
00:20:49,28 --> 00:20:50,54
No,this is great!
好棒的禮物

306
00:20:51,28 --> 00:20:54,37
-Thank you,Chandler. -Oh,yeah.
謝謝你，錢德 不客氣

307
00:20:56,28 --> 00:20:58,11
Want to go to bed?
要睡覺了嗎？

308
00:20:59,02 --> 00:21:01,18
I'll be in,in a minute.
我馬上就來

309
00:21:06,29 --> 00:21:07,89
Don't forget your coupon.
別忘了帶猛男體驗券

310
00:21:14,10 --> 00:21:15,19
Good night.
晚安

311
00:21:16,80 --> 00:21:19,20
Thank you for the gift.
謝謝你的禮物

312
00:21:20,77 --> 00:21:24,40
I just knew that sometimes when you're writing...
我只是想有時你寫字時

313
00:21:24,61 --> 00:21:27,38
...you don't always know the exact time.
不一定知道確切時間

314
00:21:28,42 --> 00:21:32,04
No,I didn't mean the pen. Thank you for the book.
我不是說這支筆 謝謝你那本書

315
00:21:33,55 --> 00:21:34,65
The book?
書？ 

316
00:21:34,89 --> 00:21:36,45
The Velveteen Rabbit?
「天鵝絨兔寶寶」

317
00:21:36,66 --> 00:21:39,56
I have a feeling you had something to do with it.
我覺得跟你有關

318
00:21:39,79 --> 00:21:40,99
What do you mean?
什麼意思？

319
00:21:41,50 --> 00:21:43,59
When Joey gave it to me he said:
喬伊送我的時候說

320
00:21:43,80 --> 00:21:48,33
"This is because I know you like rabbits,and I know you like cheese."
「因為我知道你喜歡兔子」 「也喜歡起司」

321
00:21:51,10 --> 00:21:52,97
Thanks. I love it.
謝謝，我好喜歡

322
00:21:53,17 --> 00:21:56,14
I know how hard it must have been for you to find.
你一定花了很多功夫

323
00:21:57,41 --> 00:22:01,44
In case you missed that, that sound was,"Oh,well."
如果你沒聽到 我的意思是「還好啦」

324
00:22:02,18 --> 00:22:05,48
You must really like Joey to go to all that trouble.
你一定很喜歡喬伊 才會這麼費心

325
00:22:05,75 --> 00:22:07,19
Oh,yeah. He's my
是啊，他是…

326
00:22:12,19 --> 00:22:14,42
He's my best friend.
他是我最要好的朋友

327
00:22:16,36 --> 00:22:18,63
-Well.... -Good night.
晚安

328
00:22:27,87 --> 00:22:31,11
Hey,that coupon expires,you know.
那可是限時體驗券

329
00:22:41,59 --> 00:22:44,92
You don't know me. I'm Monica Geller,Ross' sister.
你不認識我 我是摩妮卡蓋勒，羅斯的妹妹

330
00:22:45,16 --> 00:22:48,42
You know,it's too bad that didn't work out.
你好，可惜我們合不來

331
00:22:48,66 --> 00:22:50,93
Anyway,he told me about your apartment.
總之他提到你家的情況

332
00:22:51,20 --> 00:22:54,10
Well,I couldn't sleep thinking about it.
我想得睡不著

333
00:22:56,04 --> 00:22:59,53
So would it be okay if I cleaned it?
我可以幫你打掃嗎？

334
00:23:01,68 --> 00:23:02,66
不行嗎？

335
00:23:04,28 --> 00:23:06,77
I won't be able to sleep.
我會睡不著

336
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


337
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


